leep, sleep in the night; and those who are drunk are drunk in the night."},{"verse":8,"text":"But since we belong to the day, let’s be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love, and for a helmet, the hope of salvation."},{"verse":9,"text":"For God didn’t appoint us to wrath, but to the obtaining of salvation through our Lord Jesus Christ,"},{"verse":10,"text":"who died for us, that, whether we wake or sleep, we should live together with him."},{"verse":11,"text":"Therefore exhort one another, and build each other up, even as you also do."},{"verse":12,"text":"But we beg you, brothers, to know those who labor among you, and are over you in the Lord and admonish you,"},{"verse":13,"text":"and to respect and honor them in love for their work’s sake. Be at peace among yourselves."},{"verse":14,"text":"We exhort you, brothers: Admonish the disorderly; encourage the faint-hearted; support the weak; be patient toward all."},{"verse":15,"text":"See that no one returns evil for evil to anyone, but always follow after that which is good for one another and for all."},{"verse":16,"text":"Always rejoice."},{"verse":17,"text":"Pray without ceasing."},{"verse":18,"text":"In everything give thanks, for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus toward you."},{"verse":19,"text":"Don’t quench the Spirit."},{"verse":20,"text":"Don’t despise prophecies."},{"verse":21,"text":"Test all things, and hold firmly that which is good."},{"verse":22,"text":"Abstain from every form of evil."},{"verse":23,"text":"May the God of peace himself sanctify you completely. May your whole spirit, soul, and body be preserved blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ."},{"verse":24,"text":"He who calls you is faithful, who will also do it."},{"verse":25,"text":"Brothers, pray for us."},{"verse":26,"text":"Greet all the brothers with a holy kiss."},{"verse":27,"text":"I solemnly command you by the Lord that this letter be read to all the holy brothers."},{"verse":28,"text":"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/1thessalonians.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]}]